# Logs
*.log
*.jsonl
# Intent context-injection telemetry (transient diagnostics: token usage,
# selection metrics, timing). Written as `logs/injection/injection-<ts>.json`
# by `poetic intent inject`; never durable, so keep it out of the tree.
logs/injection/

